  "title": "GPGI, Inc. Announces Executive Leadership Transitions at its Segment, Husky Technologies",
  "summary": "BOLTON, Ontario, Feb. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — GPGI, Inc. (NYSE: GPGI) today announced executive leadership transitions at its segment, Husky Technologies™ (“Husky” or the “Company”). Husky Chief Executive Officer, Bradley Selleck, and Chief Financial Officer, John Linker, will depart the company in April and March, 2026, respectively. Both executives are leaving the Company for […]",
